meta {
  name: set comp mode
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

put {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/events/{{eventId}}/comps/{{compName}}/mode
  body: json
  auth: none
}

body:json {
  {
    "mode": "MANUAL"
  }
}

docs {
  Raid lead only. AUTO or MANUAL. The slots are left alone, so converting an AUTO
  comp to MANUAL hands the raid lead the assigner's last output as a starting point.

  An AUTO comp is the assigner's: locking recomputes every slot. A MANUAL comp is
  the raid lead's: locking it returns 409 and writes nothing.
}
